  "content_html": "<div class=\"product-description j-product-description\" itemprop=\"description\">\n<div class=\"text\">\n<p><strong>Shimmer Body Lotion Highlighter Romantic Date SPF 25</strong> — a combination of delicate care, a gentle radiance, and sun protection.</p>\n<p>This shimmer body lotion is designed to enhance the skin's natural beauty, giving it a well-groomed look and a soft romantic shimmer.</p>\n<p>Powered by <strong>SPF 25</strong>, this product helps protect the skin from the negative effects of ultraviolet rays when spending time outdoors. Its<strong> creamy texture </strong>distributes evenly over the body, absorbs quickly, and leaves <strong>no stickiness</strong> or greasy residue.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"800\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://betrendy.space/content/uploads/images/5e5c7b73-dc27-42b3-9524-074087e243c3-kopja-2.jpg\" width=\"600\"/></p>\n<p><strong>The formula is enriched with active ingredients</strong> that support comfort and hydration.<br/>\n<strong>Natural rose oil</strong> is known for its nourishing and softening properties and helps keep the skin smooth and elastic.<br/>\n<strong>Pearl extract</strong> promotes a feeling of ultimate care and silky softness, enhancing the skin's natural glow.<br/>\n<strong>D-panthenol </strong>promotes skin softening and supports its natural balance, helping to reduce the feeling of dryness.<br/>\n<strong>Aloe vera extract</strong> helps to moisturize and maintain a fresh, well-groomed appearance of the skin.<br/>\n<strong>Food-grade glitters</strong> create a beautiful shimmering effect, gently enhancing the skin tone.</p>\n<p>The lotion is perfect for the summer season, vacations, romantic dates, or everyday use whenever you want to add definition and a beautiful radiance to your skin.</p>\n<p><strong>Product Benefits:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>gentle shimmering effect</li>\n<li>skin hydration and softening</li>\n<li>SPF 25 </li>\n<li>lightweight texture without stickiness</li>\n<li>comfortable daily use</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Shimmer Body Lotion Highlighter Romantic Date SPF 25 — a simple way to add radiance and confidence to your skin every day.</strong></p>\n </div>\n</div>",
