livery - carrier's rates apply</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://betrendy.space/oplata-i-dostavka/\">More about delivery</a></p>\n</div>\n</div> </div>\n<div class=\"j-product-block__tab\" data-content-id=\"payment-2\" style=\"display: none;\">\n<div class=\"product__section\">\n<div class=\"text\">\n<p>Payment to the current account:</p>\n<p>Beneficiary: [PAYMENT DETAILS OMITTED] Mariia Borysivna</p>\n<p>IBAN: [PAYMENT DETAILS OMITTED]</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>Online payment via Plata by mono</p>\n</div>\n</div> </div>\n<div class=\"j-product-block__tab\" data-content-id=\"guarantee-2\" style=\"display: none;\">\n<div class=\"product__section\">\n<div class=\"text\">\n<p>12-month manufacturer's warranty.</p>\n</div>\n</div> </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"product__column-item\">\n<div class=\"product__group product__group--tabs\">\n<div class=\"product-heading\">\n<nav class=\"product-heading__nav\" id=\"nav-6af7459999a8d\">\n<a class=\"product-heading__tab\" href=\"#description-3\">\n<div class=\"product-heading__title\">Description</div>\n</a>\n<a class=\"product-heading__tab\" href=\"#reviews-3\">\n<div class=\"product-heading__title\"><div id=\"comments\">\n            A new review or comment    </div>\n</div>\n</a>\n</nav>\n</div>\n<div class=\"j-product-block__tab\" data-content-id=\"description-3\" style=\"display: none;\">\n<div class=\"product__section\">\n<div class=\"product-description j-product-description\" itemprop=\"description\">\n<div class=\"text\">\n<p><strong>Shimmer Body Lotion Highlighter Romantic Date SPF 25</strong> — a combination of delicate care, a gentle radiance, and sun protection.</p>\n<p>This shimmer body lotion is designed to enhance the skin's natural beauty, giving it a well-groomed look and a soft romantic shimmer.</p>\n<p>Powered by <strong>SPF 25</strong>, this product helps protect the skin from the negative effects of ultraviolet rays when spending time outdoors. Its<strong> creamy texture </strong>distributes evenly over the body, absorbs quickly, and leaves <strong>no stickiness</strong> or greasy residue.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"800\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://betrendy.space/content/uploads/images/5e5c7b73-dc27-42b3-9524-074087e243c3-kopja-2.jpg\" width=\"600\"/></p>\n<p><strong>The formula is enriched with active ingredients</strong> that support comfort and hydration.<br/>\n<strong>Natural rose oil</strong> is known for its nourishing and softening properties and helps keep the skin smooth and elastic.<br/>\n<strong>Pearl extract</strong> promotes a feeling of ultimate care and silky softness, enhancing the skin's natural glow.<br/>\n<strong>D-panthenol </strong>promotes skin softening and supports its natural balance, helping to reduce the feeling of dryness.<br/>\n<strong>Aloe vera extract</strong> helps to moisturize and maintain a fresh, well-groomed appearance of the skin.<br/>\n<strong>Food-grade glitters</strong> create a beautiful shimmering effect, gently enhancing the skin tone.</p>\n<p>The lotion is perfect for the summer season, vacations, romantic dates, or everyday use whenever you want to add definition and a beautiful radiance to your skin.</p>\n<p><strong>Product Benefits:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>gentle shimmering effect</li>\n<li>skin hydration and softening</li>\n<li>SPF 25 </li>\n<li>lightweight texture without stickiness</li>\n<li>comfortable daily use</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Shimmer Body Lotion Highlighter Romantic Date SPF 25 — a simple way to add radiance and confidence to your skin every day.</strong></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"j-product-block__tab\" data-content-id=\"reviews-3\" style=\"display: none;\">\n<div class=\"product__section\">\n<section class=\"product-reviews\">\n<div class=\"reviews\" id=\"comments-container-uid0ae8270427d3e32e887c6217619ddae3\">\n<div class=\"reviews__inner\">\n<div class=\"p-review\" id=\"uid0ae8270427d3e32e887c6217619ddae3\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"reviews__add-comment\">\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div> </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"product__bottom\">\n<div class=\"product__bottom-item\">\n<div class=\"j-product-block\">\n<div class=\"product-heading\">\n<div class=\"product-heading__title j-product-block-title\"><div class=\"j-product-block-title\">\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-view-block=\"associatedProducts\">\n<div class=\"product__section\">\n<div id=\"cff60d747349516ba05dab914c1bd231\" style=\"position: relative; height: 20px\">\n<div class=\"loader\" style=\"width: 10px; height: 10px; margin: 10px 0 50px -5px; left: 50%\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"product__bottom-item\">\n<div class=\"j-product-block\">\n<div class=\"product-heading\">\n<div class=\"product-heading__title j-product-block-title\"><div class=\"j-product-block-title\">\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-view-block=\"associatedProducts_1\">\n<div class=\"product__section\">\n<div id=\"9f6f3a943d2cab0f6537742634199f90\" style=\"position: relative; height: 20px\">\n<div class=\"loader\" style=\"width: 10px; height: 10px; margin: 10px 0 50px -5px; left: 50%\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"product__bottom-item\">\n<div class=\"j-product-block\">\n<div class=\"product-heading\">\n<div class=\"product-heading__title j-product-block-title\"><div class=\"j-product-block-title\">\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-view-block=\"associatedProducts_2\">\n<div class=\"product__section\">\n<div id=\"b0108ea1b728a689ce72757f5fe037b2\" style=\"position: relative; height: 20px\">\n<div class=\"loader\" style=\"width: 10px; height: 10px; margin: 10px 0 50px -5px; left: 50%\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>\n<div class=\"product__bottom-wide\">\n<div class=\"product__bottom-item\">\n<div class=\"j-product-block\">\n<div>\n<div id=\"uidc2e0e21d940affb26627898739df5c76\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</main>"
